1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 5=

15
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,840
Found them!

16
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,510
It's you two!

17
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,150
Old Madam,

18
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,400
the heavenly lightning has revealed

19
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,430
that these two women
harbor evil spirits.

20
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,820
If the spirits aren't banished,

21
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:21,480
I'm afraid the entire Marquis's Manor

22
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,430
will suffer the consequences.

23
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,550
Impossible.

24
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:24,760
My two granddaughters-in-law

25
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,040
are kindhearted and virtuous.

26
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:27,680
How could they harbor evil spirits?

27
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,760
That's right, Master.

28
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,200
Could you be mistaken?

29
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:31,120
Let's get out of here first.

30
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:34,420
Be careful!

31
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:35,290
See that?

32
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,940
The evil flames are fierce.

33
00:01:37,130 --> 00:01:38,150
If we don't subdue them now,

34
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,200
the Marquis's Manor

35
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:41,240
will face a terrible disaster!

36
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,290
But...

37
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,130
Grandmother,

38
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:45,560
look what's happened to Xiang.

39
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,450
You must make a decision quickly.

40
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:48,790
After all, both my sisters-in-law

41
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:49,870
only need to stand there.

42
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,680
Why not

43
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:52,350
let the Master perform a ritual?

44
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:54,760
Evil spirits!

45
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,290
I'll subdue you both!

46
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,080
Are you all right?

47
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:19,960
I'm fine.

48
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,630
Are you all right?

49
00:02:22,470 --> 00:02:22,750
You...

50
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,190
I'm fine.

51
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:27,840
Grandmother.

52
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:29,500
How could you believe such nonsense?

53
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,150
Enough of these tricks.

54
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:32,460
Drag her away!

55
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:34,470
Unless these two women are eliminated,

56
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,120
the Marquis's Manor
will never know peace!

57
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:39,450
Brothers,

58
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:40,420
please calm down.

59
00:02:40,730 --> 00:02:41,240
Grandmother

60
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,810
is only worried about Xiang's safety.

61
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,310
Besides,

62
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:44,430
those flames just now

63
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:45,810
only appeared around Yuyuan

64
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:46,910
and Shutiao.

65
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:47,760
It was very strange.

66
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,170
Even if you don't believe it,

67
00:02:49,170 --> 00:02:50,100
once word gets out,

68
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,730
I'm afraid others

69
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:53,190
will spread rumors
about the Marquis's Manor.

70
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,280
Apart from you,

71
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,190
who else would spread such rumors?

72
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,120
Grandmother,

73
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,680
please talk some sense into them.

74
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:01,610
Enough.

75
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,450
Until Xiang wakes up,

76
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,400
you two shall remove your
hair ornaments, dress in plain clothes,

77
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,710
and go to the ancestral hall

78
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:07,870
to pray for her recovery.

79
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,410
But...

80
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,260
We...

81
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,970
Someone is clearly setting us up.

82
00:03:12,090 --> 00:03:13,450
Arguing now would be asking for trouble.

83
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:14,630
Let's retreat.

84
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:15,780
Got it.

85
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,560
This sword scabbard

86
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,870
was made for you by Father

87
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:29,400
from rhinoceros horn and agarwood.

88
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:31,680
When we were little,
you wouldn't even let me touch it.

89
00:03:32,510 --> 00:03:33,070
And now,

90
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,220
you actually used it
to shield Yuyuan from the flames.

91
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:36,630
Well...

92
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:39,080
If she dies, I'll die too.

93
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:43,680
My brother

94
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,680
would never say anything so sentimental.

95
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,360
Whoever you are,

96
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,440
get out of his body right now!

97
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:51,480
Go!

98
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:52,120
Get out!

99
00:03:52,470 --> 00:03:52,750
Get out!

100
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,080
Go!

101
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:53,500
Get out!

102
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:53,890
Go!

103
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:54,470
Get lost!

104
00:03:58,580 --> 00:04:00,660
(Admonitions for Women)

105
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,010
Something's definitely going on.

106
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,190
There's definitely something
between you two.

107
00:04:11,090 --> 00:04:12,040
Which two?

108
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:13,010
You and the Fire-Shielding Guy
who shielded you from the flames.

109
00:04:13,010 --> 00:04:14,540
What Fire-Shielding Guy?

110
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,060
He only shielded me from the flames

111
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,180
because he didn't want
to lose his antidote.

112
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,560
He's afraid of dying,

113
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:22,440
not afraid of me dying.

114
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:38,870
Cheng, look!

115
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:40,680
There's something wrong
with this outfit.

116
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,280
Something was wrong
with today's fire incident.

117
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,800
I'm not entirely sure

118
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,560
how the fire started,

119
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,360
but Xiang

120
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,560
was definitely faking it.

121
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:52,440
Faking it?

122
00:04:54,210 --> 00:04:55,520
When that talisman burned

123
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,070
in front of Xiang today,

124
00:04:57,670 --> 00:04:58,750
I noticed her eyes

125
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,310
visibly flinched.

126
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,920
But someone who's unconscious

127
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,310
would never react like that.

128
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:08,680
So Xiang was definitely pretending.

129
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:11,120
Then why didn't
you expose her on the spot?

130
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,570
You saw

131
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,340
what happened today.

132
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:16,240
They even brought out
those supernatural flames.

133
00:05:17,110 --> 00:05:18,430
You can't wake someone

134
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:19,970
who's pretending to be asleep.

135
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,430
Are you sure we can't?

136
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:24,820
Yes.

137
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,070
I have an idea.

138
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:41,040
Do we really have to resort
to such a nasty trick?

139
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,170
What are you talking about?

140
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,830
Think about it.

141
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,670
Are we the ones playing dirty,

142
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:47,590
or are they the ones
doing terrible things?

143
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,580
Good point.

144
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:51,000
We'll do it your way.

145
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,370
It's been an entire night.

146
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:59,190
Why hasn't Xiang shown any response?

147
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,580
Grandmother,

148
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:01,730
why don't we

149
00:06:01,730 --> 00:06:03,090
invite the Taoist master back?

150
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:05,150
We have a way.

151
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,080
Yuyuan, Shutiao,

152
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,840
Grandmother hasn't given her permission.

153
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,420
How dare you disobey her orders

154
00:06:27,550 --> 00:06:28,740
and leave the ancestral hall
without permission?

155
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,510
Grandmother,

156
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:35,240
I spent last night
in the ancestral hall,

157
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,070
keeping vigil and praying for Xiang.

158
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:38,720
Fortunately, an ancestor
appeared in my dream.

159
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,130
He told me

160
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:42,510
Xiang isn't merely unconscious.

161
00:06:42,730 --> 00:06:44,680
Her soul is trapped by an evil spirit.

162
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:47,100
Our ancestor also taught me

163
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,700
the Five Thunder Heart
Purification Technique.

164
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:50,870
Xiang's condition is critical.

165
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:52,310
Why not let us try?

166
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,950
An ancestor appeared in your dream?

167
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,000
Grandmother,

168
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:56,090
such claims are utterly absurd.

169
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,040
What if they make

170
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,360
Xiang's condition worse?

171
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,070
You'd rather believe

172
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:01,480
a Taoist priest of unknown origin

173
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,230
than trust

174
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:04,070
the ancestors of the Marquis's family?

175
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:10,620
The ancestors of the Marquis's family

176
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,830
are watching you

177
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:13,870
in disappointment from heaven!

178
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,560
We have no other options right now.

179
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:17,500
Then give it a try.

180
00:07:17,690 --> 00:07:19,060
(You wretches.)

181
00:07:19,390 --> 00:07:20,660
(Whatever tricks you try,)

182
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,460
(I won't wake up even
if you beat me to death!)

183
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,830
First technique.

184
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,700
Soul Stabilization
and Meridian Awakening.

185
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:40,000
We must use the force of our palms

186
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:43,000
to disperse the evil energy
blocking her face.

187
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,830
Grandmother!

188
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,270
Isn't that just slapping her?

189
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:49,560
What kind of treatment is that?

190
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,390
Shutiao,

191
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,950
you're clearly making fools of us!

192
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:52,960
Grandmother,

193
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,120
our ancestor said

194
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:55,600
we must fight poison with poison.

195
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,240
The evil energy is trapped in her face.

196
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,220
Unless we disperse it,

197
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,240
it can't escape.

198
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:00,270
I can confirm that!

199
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,360
I had the same dream.

200
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:02,710
Then continue.

201
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:23,560
(Her eyes are practically flashing,
yet she won't wake up.)

202
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,240
(She has incredible endurance.)

203
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,600
(No wonder she's the reigning champion
of household scheming.)

204
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:32,360
Stop hitting her.

205
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,780
You can't keep doing this.

206
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,870
Even a healthy person couldn't withstand

207
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,460
such a brutal beating!

208
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,270
Exactly!

209
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:40,910
At least Yuyuan has some sense.

210
00:08:41,270 --> 00:08:41,910
Grandmother,

211
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,440
my second technique

212
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,780
is much

213
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:45,700
gentler than that.

214
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,980
It's called the Origin Restoration
and Evil Sealing Technique.

215
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,690
Bring in the equipment.

216
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,450
What is that?

217
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,770
Why does it smell so awful?

218
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:06,500
The Origin Restoration
and Evil Sealing Technique

219
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:09,490
involves covering the face with the most
yin-rich soil from a filthy place

220
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,560
to force the evil spirit

221
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:12,010
out of hiding.

222
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:12,870
What exactly

223
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,540
is this

224
00:09:13,690 --> 00:09:15,160
yin-rich soil from a filthy place?

225
00:09:15,370 --> 00:09:16,320
Grandmother,

226
00:09:18,060 --> 00:09:18,970
it's

227
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:22,440
soil dug three feet deep
beside a latrine.

228
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:24,790
Nourished by daily watering,

229
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:27,480
it absorbs the essence
of the sun and moon

230
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,600
and gathers the spiritual energy
of heaven and earth.

231
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:35,080
Simply cover her face with the soil

232
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,440
and seal her mouth and nose

233
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:39,340
to expel the evil spirit from her body.

234
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,750
This is sheer madness!

235
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,940
Using such disgraceful methods!

236
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:44,000
Exactly.

237
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,600
The more unconventional the method,

238
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,670
the more miraculous its effects.

239
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,690
Xiang's condition is critical.

240
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:49,790
I beg you, Grandmother,

241
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:51,600
let Yuyuan give it a try.

242
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:52,910
Grandmother,

243
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:53,940
you mustn't!

244
00:09:54,330 --> 00:09:55,120
If it works,

245
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:56,820
then let's try it.

246
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:57,930
All right!

247
00:09:58,780 --> 00:10:00,550
Here comes a spoonful!

248
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:13,160
It stinks!

249
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:14,770
I can't take it anymore!

250
00:10:23,530 --> 00:10:25,850
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

251
00:10:25,850 --> 00:10:33,050
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

252
00:10:33,050 --> 00:10:38,250
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

253
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:44,490
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

254
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:50,950
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

255
00:10:52,290 --> 00:10:57,410
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

256
00:10:58,690 --> 00:11:02,080
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

257
00:11:20,810 --> 00:11:24,180
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
